{# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

   get.<site>/ca-roots/ — the CA roots an operator adds with `goat ca add`.

   goat-cli compiles in no goatnet CA. A root arrives from here (or any
   channel the operator already trusts) and is confirmed by fingerprint. The
   fingerprints below come from ops/enrollment/ca-root-fingerprint.py at deploy
   time and are byte-identical to what `goat ca add` prints — that equality is
   the entire point of the page, so do not render a fingerprint computed any
   other way.

   This page does NOT establish trust. It is served over the mesh, so reaching
   it already means enrolled — but an operator adding a root for a goatnet they
   have not joined yet must still check the fingerprint against a value from a
   person, not from this page.
#}
<!doctype html>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>CA roots — {{ goat_get_hostname }}</title>
<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light dark;
    --bg: #ffffff; --fg: #16181d; --muted: #5b6270;
    --rule: #d9dde5; --card: #f6f7f9; --accent: #7a4b18;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root { --bg: #14161a; --fg: #e8eaee; --muted: #98a0ae;
            --rule: #2b2f37; --card: #1c1f25; --accent: #d9a05b; }
  }
  body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); margin: 0;
         font: 16px/1.6 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }
  main { max-width: 62rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 4rem; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 0 0 .35rem; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  p.lede { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 2rem; max-width: 46rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 2.5rem 0 .75rem; }
  code, pre { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  pre { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 6px;
        padding: .8rem 1rem; overflow-x: auto; font-size: .875rem; }
  .wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: .9rem; }
  th, td { text-align: left; padding: .6rem .75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
           vertical-align: top; }
  th { font-weight: 600; font-size: .78rem; text-transform: uppercase;
       letter-spacing: .06em; color: var(--muted); }
  td.fp { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
          font-size: .78rem; word-break: break-all; }
  a { color: var(--accent); }
  .note { border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); background: var(--card);
          padding: .8rem 1rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0; }
</style>
<main>
  <h1>CA roots</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    <code>goat</code> has no goatnet built into it. To install a profile from a
    bundle, add the CA root for the goatnet that issued it. One binary works
    against every goatnet whose root you have added.
  </p>

  <h2>Add a root</h2>
  <pre>curl -LO https://{{ goat_get_hostname }}/{{ goat_get_ca_roots_www_subdir }}/&lt;file&gt;
goat ca add &lt;file&gt;
goat ca ls</pre>

  <div class="note">
    <strong>Check the fingerprint.</strong> <code>goat ca add</code> prints one.
    Compare it against a fingerprint you got from a person — not from this page.
    Anyone who can hand you a file can hand you a root.
  </div>

  <h2>Available roots</h2>
  <div class="wrap">
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>CA-ID</th><th>Fingerprint (SHA-256 of the public key)</th><th>File</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
{% for r in goat_get_ca_roots_rows %}
      <tr>
        <td><code>{{ r.ca_id }}</code></td>
        <td class="fp">{{ r.fingerprint }}</td>
        <td><a href="{{ r.path | basename }}">{{ r.path | basename }}</a></td>
      </tr>
{% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>

  <h2>Remove one</h2>
  <pre>goat ca rm &lt;ca-id&gt;</pre>
  <p style="color: var(--muted); font-size: .875rem;">
    Bundles signed by that CA stop verifying on this machine. Nothing else changes.
  </p>

  <p style="color: var(--muted); font-size: .8rem; margin-top: 3rem;">
    Served by {{ goat_get_hostname }} · <a href="../">all downloads</a>
  </p>
</main>
